---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Bâti-Axe — Construction Marketplace Case Study"
  description="Architecture and technical details of Bâti-Axe, a double-sided construction marketplace."
>
  <header class="header" role="banner">
    <nav class="nav" aria-label="Main Navigation">
      <a href="/#work" class="logo" aria-label="Back to home">&larr; Back</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="case-study-main">
    <article class="case-study-content">
      <header class="cs-header">
        <div class="badge">Marketplace & IaC</div>
        <h1>Bâti-Axe</h1>
        <p class="cs-lead">A highly-regulated, double-sided marketplace bridging the gap between homeowners needing verified construction professionals and artisans seeking leads.</p>
        
        <div class="cs-meta">
          <div class="meta-item">
            <span class="meta-label">Role</span>
            <span class="meta-value">Lead Architect</span>
          </div>
          <div class="meta-item">
            <span class="meta-label">Stack</span>
            <span class="meta-value">Nuxt 4, Vue 3, Terraform, Stripe</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="cs-body">
        <div class="architecture-grid">
          <div class="arch-layer">
            <h3>☁️ Infrastructure Layer</h3>
            <p><strong>Terraform (IaC)</strong></p>
            <p>The entire platform is defined immutably using Terraform. From Cloudflare DNS and Pages deployments to the Supabase database configurations, staging and production are mathematically identical.</p>
            
            <div class="cs-code-block" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
              <div class="code-header">
                <span class="dot-red"></span><span class="dot-yellow"></span><span class="dot-green"></span>
                <span class="code-title">terraform/main.tf</span>
              </div>
              <div class="code-body">
                <span class="kw">module</span> <span class="str">"cloudflare_pages"</span> {'{'}
                <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="kw">source</span> = <span class="str">"./modules/cloudflare"</span>
                <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;project_name = <span class="str">"bati-axe-app"</span>
                <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;environment  = <span class="kw">var</span>.env
                <br>{'}'}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="arch-layer">
            <h3>⚙️ Backend & Data Layer</h3>
            <p><strong>Supabase & Stripe Webhooks</strong></p>
            <p>The monetization engine is entirely serverless. Supabase Edge Functions intercept Stripe webhook events securely, instantly provisioning or revoking access to premium leads directly within the PostgreSQL database.</p>
            
            <h4>Storage Optimization</h4>
            <p>Direct-to-R2 uploads handle massive portfolio images and legal documents, entirely bypassing Supabase's storage bandwidth limitations and reducing infrastructure costs.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="arch-layer">
            <h3>🌐 Frontend Layer</h3>
            <p><strong>Nuxt 4 & Vue 3 (Server-Side Rendered)</strong></p>
            <p>A highly interactive double-sided marketplace providing SEO-optimized landing pages for homeowners and a dynamic, gated dashboard for construction professionals.</p>
            
            <h4>Magic-Link Auth</h4>
            <p>Passwordless authentication via Resend guarantees zero friction for less tech-savvy professionals, driving higher conversion rates on lead purchases.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2 id="demo">Live Environments & Access</h2>
        <p>You can access the production environment directly below. Some features may require an account to view, but the main landing and professional directory are public.</p>

        <div class="demo-grid">
          <div class="demo-card" style="grid-column: 1 / -1;">
            <h3>Bâti-Axe Production</h3>
            <p>The live production marketplace.</p>
            <div class="demo-creds">
              <span class="cred-label">URL:</span> <a href="https://bati-axe-production.pages.dev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">bati-axe-production.pages.dev</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .header {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    z-index: 50;
    background: rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.8);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .nav {
    display: flex;
    width: 92%;
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1rem 0;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
  }
  .logo {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .logo:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .case-study-main {
    padding: 8rem 1.25rem 5rem;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }
  .case-study-content {
    width: 92%;
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 3rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .case-study-content {
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    }
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    color: var(--text-primary);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
  }

  .cs-header h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .cs-lead {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .cs-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .meta-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }
  .meta-value {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .cs-body h2 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .cs-body p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .cs-list {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }
  .cs-list li {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .cs-list strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .cs-code-block {
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }
  .code-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .code-title {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
  }
  .dot-red { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FF5F57; }
  .dot-yellow { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #FFBD2E; }
  .dot-green { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #28C840; }
  .code-body {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'Cascadia Code', 'Fira Code', monospace;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .kw { color: #cba6f7; }
  .fn { color: #89b4fa; }
  .str { color: #a6e3a1; }
  .num { color: #fab387; }

  .demo-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  @media (min-width: 600px) {
    .demo-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }
  .demo-card {
    background: var(--bg-base);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }
  .demo-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }
  .demo-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .demo-creds {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .cred-label {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    display: inline-block;
    width: 45px;
  }
  .demo-creds a {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .demo-creds a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .architecture-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin: 3rem 0;
  }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .architecture-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }
  }
  .arch-layer {
    background: var(--bg-elevated);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 2rem;
  }
  .arch-layer h3 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }
  .arch-layer h4 {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0.5rem 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  .arch-layer p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .arch-layer p + p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
</style>
